{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated tracks, meet their inhabitants, and destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Space Arcade is a 3D reinterpretation of the retro arcade shooter experience. Get ready for non-stop action as you jump, dodge and blast your way through heaps of colorful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.poster.avif?t=1766151910\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.webm?t=1766151910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.mp4?t=1766151910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level will be more challenging then the one before, with new obstacles and enemies. Power up with a variety of upgrades and special abilities, including blaster upgrades, invincibility shields, auto-fire and more.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.poster.avif?t=1766151910\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.webm?t=1766151910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.mp4?t=1766151910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with \u2764\ufe0f by a solo-dev in Berlin.</p>","background":"https://